# Global Fuel Prices and Taxation Trends

## Project Overview
This project explores global fuel prices and taxation trends using Tableau. It aims to present fuel price data through interactive visualizations and help users understand differences across countries.

## Objectives
- Analyze fuel prices across countries.
- Explore differences in petrol and diesel prices, where available.
- Examine fuel taxation trends using the available dataset.
- Present insights through charts and dashboards in Tableau.

## Tools Used
- Tableau Public / Tableau
- Microsoft Excel or CSV for data handling
- GitHub for project documentation and version control

## Project Workflow
1. Obtain and review the fuel price dataset.
2. Prepare and organize the data.
3. Create visualizations in Tableau.
4. Combine the charts into a dashboard.
5. Document the project and its findings.

## Dashboard
Dashboard screenshots will be added to this repository.

## Key Findings
Insights will be documented after reviewing the completed Tableau charts and dataset.

## Project Files
- `data/` — Dataset, if permitted to share.
- `tableau/` — Tableau workbook.
- `screenshots/` — Dashboard screenshots.
- `Project_Report.md` — Project report.

## Conclusion
This project uses data visualization to explore global fuel prices and taxation patterns. The completed dashboard will help communicate comparisons and trends clearly.

